{"id":"86f066ce34d052a8","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-counting-reduction.md","title":"保持计数的多项式归约","display":"df-counting-reduction — 保持计数的多项式归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-counting-reduction","aliases":["28-df-counting-reduction"],"display":"df-counting-reduction — 保持计数的多项式归约","depends_on":["[[28-df-sharp-p]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; 344–346","source_printed_pages":"344–346","source_pdf_pages":"370–372","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-counting-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-counting-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-counting-reduction — 保持计数的多项式归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9470641051e0a7af\" href=\"?note=9470641051e0a7af\" title=\"28-df-sharp-p\">28-df-sharp-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; 344–346"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"344–346"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"370–372"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f,g:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a> 的全字符串函数接口，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#\\mathbf P\">\\(\\#\\mathbf P\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9470641051e0a7af\" href=\"?note=9470641051e0a7af\" title=\"28-df-sharp-p\">28-df-sharp-p</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}:\\mathbb N\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}:\\mathbb N\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 是无前导零二进制表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\\)</span>。本条的下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{par}\">\\(\\mathrm{par}\\)</span> 专指精确保持计数的归约。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\le_{\\mathrm{par}}^{\\mathbf P}g\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists R\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\ f(x)=g(R(x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\le_{\\mathrm{par}}^{\\mathbf P}g\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists R\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\ f(x)=g(R(x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathrm{par}}\\coloneqq\\{g\\in\\#\\mathbf P:\\forall f\\in\\#\\mathbf P\\ f\\le_{\\mathrm{par}}^{\\mathbf P}g\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathrm{par}}\\coloneqq\\{g\\in\\#\\mathbf P:\\forall f\\in\\#\\mathbf P\\ f\\le_{\\mathrm{par}}^{\\mathbf P}g\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\{f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{bin}\\circ f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{FP}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\{f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{bin}\\circ f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是函数的精确保持计数归约，比允许多次查询及后处理的图灵归约更强。原书Theorem17.10证明说明证书双射，并把这种归约称为parsimonious；其括号还容许已知比例因子，本目录用精确等式固定较严格版本，不能把这个版本直接用于Valiant永久式定理。数值FP另加下标以免把字符串函数和自然数函数混为同一个集合。</p>\n<p>来源：§17.2–17.3、Theorem17.10证明，印刷344–346 / PDF370–372。已经核对对应原文；这里的新关系与现有函数图灵归约分别命名，无循环或签名覆盖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-sharp-p","status":"resolved","id":"9470641051e0a7af","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sharp-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$f,g:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N$；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 采用 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]] 的全字符串函数接口，$\\#\\mathbf P$ 见 [[28-df-sharp-p]]。\n$\\operatorname{bin}:\\mathbb N\\to\\Sigma^*$ 是无前导零二进制表示，$\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0$。本条的下标 $\\mathrm{par}$ 专指精确保持计数的归约。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sharp-p","status":"resolved","id":"9470641051e0a7af","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$f,g:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N$；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 采用 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]] 的全字符串函数接口，$\\#\\mathbf P$ 见 [[28-df-sharp-p]]。\n$\\operatorname{bin}:\\mathbb N\\to\\Sigma^*$ 是无前导零二进制表示，$\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0$。本条的下标 $\\mathrm{par}$ 专指精确保持计数的归约。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f,g:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\#\\mathbf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}:\\mathbb N\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{par}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\le_{\\mathrm{par}}^{\\mathbf P}g\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists R\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\ f(x)=g(R(x)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathrm{par}}\\coloneqq\\{g\\in\\#\\mathbf P:\\forall f\\in\\#\\mathbf P\\ f\\le_{\\mathrm{par}}^{\\mathbf P}g\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\{f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{bin}\\circ f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2005,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-235","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"计数复杂性与隔离引理：[[28-df-sharp-sat]]、[[28-df-counting-reduction]]、[[28-thm-sharp-sat-complete]]、[[28-thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat]]、[[28-thm-hash-isolation]]。"},{"id":"533a7b5c79de3204","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\#\\mathrm{SAT}$ 见 [[28-df-sharp-sat]]；$\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathrm{par}}$ 与 $\\le_{\\mathrm{par}}^{\\mathbf P}$ 见 [[28-df-counting-reduction]]；图灵完全性见 [[28-df-sharp-p-oracle]]。\n采用 [[28-thm-cook-levin]] 的确定型验证计算编码；所有证书长度固定为 [[28-df-sharp-p]] 的 $p(|x|)$，不同证书不按计算前缀重复计数。"}],"outgoing":["9470641051e0a7af","adb92775ec020a0b"]}